# PDFs are binary. Say so explicitly rather than leaving git to sniff it:
# this repo carries a few hundred of them and the working tree is full of
# CRLF/LF conversion, which must never be applied to a PDF.
*.pdf binary -text -diff

# Git LFS is deliberately NOT used for these. See the note in
# js/exam-pdfs.js next to PDF_ROOTS for why.
